## Notes for agents

* Call a collection `list`/`index` action first to discover resource ids.
* Read-only actions (`allow :get` actions that only read) are safe to repeat. Ask the operator before any action that deletes data or runs code.
* A failed action is not retried automatically; read the `error` field before trying again.
